(text "17 direct GPIO keys - same PCB for both hands" (at 25.4 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid 008102e9-c427-47b8-a428-40b9752c718a))
(text "U1: One controller, two alternative socket sets.\nLEFT: use L rows from F side.\nRIGHT: use R rows from B side.\nModule components FACE DOWN towards keyboard PCB.\nFit ONE controller per PCB. No MCU jumpers." (at 270 100 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid 225a591b-fe61-4fc5-902f-a51590b75779))
(text "Left: keys and accessories on F side; controller in L rows.\nRight: flip PCB, keys and accessories on B side; controller in R rows.\nTRRS: R1=SERIAL (RX), R2=VCC, T/S=GND.\nSW_POWER1 has F/B pads; fit one switch on the key side." (at 25.4 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid 60b84ba0-045f-41e8-b08e-f56c671ae9f6))
